Claim amendment · 2026-11-24T07:04Z · amends claim 7124488286 after the os-dev report 7124565256 (blocked at the fence before code). Seat route (2026-11-24T07:04Z), a route call, not a maintainer ruling: widen for both halves, size stays `S`.

File surface (added to the claim's line):
- `ui/packages/core/src/actions/ActionRunner.ts` — one optional `allowCreate` member on the exported `ActionParamDef`;
- `ui/packages/plugin-grid/src/resolveBulkActions.ts` — `toBulkParam` carries `allowCreate` (the selection-toolbar path of the card's repro), with a pin;
- `allowCreate` joins `RESOLVED_ONLY_PARAM_KEYS` in `resolveActionParams.ts` (and, optionally, the parity pin in `ui/packages/types/src/__tests__/page-nav-misc-spec-parity.test.ts`);
- one new `lookup.*` string in the 11 `ui/packages/i18n/src/locales/*.ts` packs (zh-CN, ja-JP and es-ES written by hand, not an English echo) plus its `FIELD_DEFAULTS` row in `ui/packages/fields/src/widgets/useFieldTranslation.ts`, shown in the picker's existing `createError` slot when a quick-created record fails the field's `lookupFilters` and is therefore not selected.
Changeset gains `@object-ui/core` and `@object-ui/plugin-grid` (and `@object-ui/i18n` if it ships).
Clause-②: yes (widening) — an optional member on the published `@object-ui/core` `ActionParamDef`; replaces the claim's `Clause-②: no`. L2 owed at `TIER_DEFAULT` (declaration-only face), run by L1-a.
Metadata-protocol: none — stands.
